  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Component Integration**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/src/components/FlightHUD.tsx` and `/src/components/SettingsPanel.tsx`. I\'ve been mentally inspecting specific lines in `FlightHUD.tsx` \342\200\223 specifically lines 210\342\200\223345 and lines 540\342\200\223650 \342\200\223 after having already scanned the entire file. I\'m focusing on incorporating a subtle center deadzone ellipse/rounded-rect ref for improved UI feedback.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Feedback**\n\nI\'ve incorporated a center deadzone cue using a subtle dashed cyan outline, only visible when the deadzone exceeds 0.005, within `aimBoundarySvgRef`. I compute the boundary with `computeRoundedRectBoundary` and updated `aimReticleRef` visuals. The reticle now displays different states - \'deadzone\', \'active\', and \'max\' - with varying scale and color. I\'ve also added updated data attributes to `aimReticleRef`, including `steeringZone`, `radial`, `steerX`, `steerY`, `screenX`, and `screenY`.\n\n\n**Updating Visuals & Data**\n\nI\'m now focusing on further visual refinements and data updates. I\'ve updated `aimBoundarySvgRef.dataset` with shape, viewport dimensions, and rounded-rect parameters. The `steerLineRef` now only shows when outside the deadzone. I\'m also working on `SettingsPanel.tsx`, specifically updating the `SteeringCurvePreview` to include a clear deadzone visualization and a marker at the joystick radius. The Virtual Joystick section controls are being cleaned up.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "uy3_arLCG6--_uMPpKCl6AU"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8139944919116907614"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Update FlightHUD aiming boundary, deadzone indicator, and reticle telemetry for the 30% x 35% Virtual Joystick model\", \"Instruction\":\"Import STEERING_CONFIG, add deadzone center indicator, update boundary computation with joystickRadius, and update reticle/boundary feedback for deadzone/active/max zones\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":8, \"ReplacementContent\":\"import { SHIP_CONFIGS } from \'../config/ships\';\\nimport { STEERING_CONFIG } from \'../config/steering\';\\nimport { computeRoundedRectBoundary, createRoundedRectBoundary } from \'../engine/AimBoundary\';\\nimport { MAX_ENEMIES } from \'../engine/combat/CombatManager\';\\nimport type { FlightTelemetry, GameSettings, ShipId } from \'../types/game\';\\nimport type { MissionHudSnapshot } from \'../types/mission\';\", \"StartLine\":3, \"TargetContent\":\"import { SHIP_CONFIGS } from \'../config/ships\';\\nimport { computeRoundedRectBoundary, createRoundedRectBoundary } from \'../engine/AimBoundary\';\\nimport { MAX_ENEMIES } from \'../engine/combat/CombatManager\';\\nimport type { FlightTelemetry, GameSettings, ShipId } from \'../types/game\';\\nimport type { MissionHudSnapshot } from \'../types/mission\';\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":74, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const aimBoundarySvgRef = useRef<SVGSVGElement>(null);\\n  const cornerPathRefs = useRef<Array<SVGPathElement | null>>([null, null, null, null]);\\n  const deadzoneRectRef = useRef<SVGRectElement>(null);\\n  const lastBoundaryKeyRef = useRef(\'\');\\n  const boundaryScratchRef = useRef(createRoundedRectBoundary());\\n  const boresightRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const steerLineRef = useRef<SVGLineElement>(null);\", \"StartLine\":67, \"TargetContent\":\"  const aimBoundarySvgRef = useRef<SVGSVGElement>(null);\\n  const cornerPathRefs = useRef<Array<SVGPathElement | null>>([null, null, null, null]);\\n  const lastBoundaryKeyRef = useRef(\'\');\\n  const boundaryScratchRef = useRef(createRoundedRectBoundary());\\n  const boresightRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n  const steerLineRef = useRef<SVGLineElement>(null);\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":336, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      // 4. Bounded Virtual Joystick Reticle (30% x 35% rounded-rectangle boundary)\\n      //    + 3D Cannon Boresight Reticle + Radial Steering Vector Tether\\n      const aimPxX = t.aimScreenX * vw;\\n      const aimPxY = t.aimScreenY * vh;\\n      const borePxX = t.boresightScreenX * vw;\\n      const borePxY = t.boresightScreenY * vh;\\n      const cx = vw * 0.5;\\n      const cy = vh * 0.5;\\n\\n      if (aimReticleRef.current) {\\n        const reticleScale =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'max\'\\n            ? 1.08\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'deadzone\'\\n              ? 0.94\\n              : 1.0;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.style.transform = `translate3d(${aimPxX.toFixed(1)}px, ${aimPxY.toFixed(1)}px, 0) translate(-50%, -50%) scale(${reticleScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.steeringZone = t.steeringZone;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.radial = t.joystickRadialMagnitude.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.steerX = t.steeringOutputX.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.steerY = t.steeringOutputY.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.screenX = t.aimScreenX.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.screenY = t.aimScreenY.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.style.color =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'max\'\\n            ? \'#e0f2fe\'\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'deadzone\'\\n              ? \'rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.85)\'\\n              : \'rgba(165, 243, 252, 0.95)\';\\n      }\\n\\n      if (boresightRef.current) {\\n        const recoilScale = t.isFiring ? 1 + t.weaponCooldownRatio * 0.14 : 1;\\n        boresightRef.current.style.transform = `translate3d(${borePxX.toFixed(1)}px, ${borePxY.toFixed(1)}px, 0) translate(-50%, -50%) scale(${recoilScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (aimRingRef.current) {\\n        const ringScale = 1 + t.boostIntensity * 0.24 + (t.isFiring ? 0.08 : 0);\\n        aimRingRef.current.style.transform = `scale(${ringScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n        aimRingRef.current.style.opacity = String(\\n          (0.24 + t.boostIntensity * 0.45 + (t.isFiring ? 0.22 : 0)).toFixed(2),\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Subtle sci-fi rounded-rectangle corner markings (30% x 35% base viewport geometry scaled by joystickRadius)\\n      if (aimBoundarySvgRef.current) {\\n        const b = computeRoundedRectBoundary(\\n          vw,\\n          vh,\\n          s.joystickRadius,\\n          STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryWidth,\\n          STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryHeight,\\n          STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryCornerRadius,\\n          boundaryScratchRef.current,\\n        );\\n        const key = `${vw.toFixed(1)}:${vh.toFixed(1)}:${b.widthPx.toFixed(1)}:${b.heightPx.toFixed(1)}:${b.cornerRadiusPx.toFixed(1)}:${s.deadzone.toFixed(3)}`;\\n        if (key !== lastBoundaryKeyRef.current) {\\n          lastBoundaryKeyRef.current = key;\\n          const x0 = cx - b.halfW;\\n          const x1 = cx + b.halfW;\\n          const y0 = cy - b.halfH;\\n          const y1 = cy + b.halfH;\\n          const r = b.cornerRadiusPx;\\n          const arm = Math.max(8, Math.min(18, Math.min(b.innerHalfW, b.innerHalfH) * 0.24));\\n\\n          const paths = [\\n            // Top-left rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} L ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r).toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${(x0 + r).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} L ${(x0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Top-right rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${(x1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} L ${(x1 - r).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r).toFixed(1)} L ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Bottom-right rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} L ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r).toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${(x1 - r).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} L ${(x1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Bottom-left rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${(x0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} L ${(x0 + r).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r).toFixed(1)} L ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)}`,\\n          ];\\n\\n          for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n            cornerPathRefs.current[i]?.setAttribute(\'d\', paths[i]);\\n          }\\n\\n          if (deadzoneRectRef.current) {\\n            if (s.deadzone > 0.005) {\\n              const dzW = b.widthPx * s.deadzone;\\n              const dzH = b.heightPx * s.deadzone;\\n              const dzR = b.cornerRadiusPx * s.deadzone;\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'x\', (cx - dzW * 0.5).toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'y\', (cy - dzH * 0.5).toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'width\', dzW.toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'height\', dzH.toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'rx\', dzR.toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.setAttribute(\'ry\', dzR.toFixed(1));\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.style.visibility = \'visible\';\\n            } else {\\n              deadzoneRectRef.current.style.visibility = \'hidden\';\\n            }\\n          }\\n\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.shape = \'rounded-rect\';\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.viewportWidth = vw.toFixed(1);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.viewportHeight = vh.toFixed(1);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.widthPx = b.widthPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.heightPx = b.heightPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.cornerRadiusPx = b.cornerRadiusPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.widthFraction = b.widthFraction.toFixed(4);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.heightFraction = b.heightFraction.toFixed(4);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.joystickRadius = s.joystickRadius.toFixed(3);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.deadzone = s.deadzone.toFixed(3);\\n        }\\n\\n        const rMag = t.joystickRadialMagnitude;\\n        const edgeOp =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'max\'\\n            ? 0.42\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'active\'\\n              ? 0.12 + rMag * 0.24\\n              : 0.1;\\n        aimBoundarySvgRef.current.style.opacity = edgeOp.toFixed(2);\\n        aimBoundarySvgRef.current.style.color =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'max\'\\n            ? \'rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.95)\'\\n            : \'rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.78)\';\\n      }\\n\\n      if (steerLineRef.current) {\\n        const dx = aimPxX - cx;\\n        const dy = aimPxY - cy;\\n        const distPx = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n        if (t.steeringZone !== \'deadzone\' && distPx > 12) {\\n          const ux = dx / distPx;\\n          const uy = dy / distPx;\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'x1\', (cx + ux * 10).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'y1\', (cy + uy * 10).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'x2\', (aimPxX - ux * 18).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'y2\', (aimPxY - uy * 18).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.style.opacity = String(\\n            Math.min(0.46, 0.12 + t.joystickRadialMagnitude * 0.34).toFixed(2),\\n          );\\n        } else {\\n          steerLineRef.current.style.opacity = \'0\';\\n        }\\n      }\", \"StartLine\":211, \"TargetContent\":\"      // 4. Persistent Virtual Mouse Steering Cursor (stays at any screen edge, zero rollback)\\n      //    + 3D Cannon Boresight Reticle + Subtle Deflection Steering Vector\\n      const aimPxX = t.aimScreenX * vw;\\n      const aimPxY = t.aimScreenY * vh;\\n      const borePxX = t.boresightScreenX * vw;\\n      const borePxY = t.boresightScreenY * vh;\\n      const cx = vw * 0.5;\\n      const cy = vh * 0.5;\\n\\n      if (aimReticleRef.current) {\\n        const accelScale =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'acceleration\'\\n            ? 1 + t.steeringAccelRatio * 0.1\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'transition\'\\n              ? 0.96\\n              : 1;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.style.transform = `translate3d(${aimPxX.toFixed(1)}px, ${aimPxY.toFixed(1)}px, 0) translate(-50%, -50%) scale(${accelScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.steeringZone = t.steeringZone;\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.sensX = t.steeringSensitivityX.toFixed(3);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.sensY = t.steeringSensitivityY.toFixed(3);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.screenX = t.aimScreenX.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.screenY = t.aimScreenY.toFixed(4);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.excessX = t.aimExcessX.toFixed(1);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.dataset.excessY = t.aimExcessY.toFixed(1);\\n        aimReticleRef.current.style.color =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'acceleration\'\\n            ? \'#e0f2fe\'\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'transition\'\\n              ? \'#fcd34d\'\\n              : \'rgba(165, 243, 252, 0.95)\';\\n      }\\n\\n      if (boresightRef.current) {\\n        const recoilScale = t.isFiring ? 1 + t.weaponCooldownRatio * 0.14 : 1;\\n        boresightRef.current.style.transform = `translate3d(${borePxX.toFixed(1)}px, ${borePxY.toFixed(1)}px, 0) translate(-50%, -50%) scale(${recoilScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n      }\\n\\n      if (aimRingRef.current) {\\n        const ringScale = 1 + t.boostIntensity * 0.24 + (t.isFiring ? 0.08 : 0);\\n        aimRingRef.current.style.transform = `scale(${ringScale.toFixed(3)})`;\\n        aimRingRef.current.style.opacity = String(\\n          (0.24 + t.boostIntensity * 0.45 + (t.isFiring ? 0.22 : 0)).toFixed(2),\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Subtle sci-fi rounded-rectangle corner markings (exact 40% x 45% viewport geometry, zero solid box)\\n      if (aimBoundarySvgRef.current) {\\n        const b = computeRoundedRectBoundary(\\n          vw,\\n          vh,\\n          s.aimBoundaryWidth,\\n          s.aimBoundaryHeight,\\n          s.aimBoundaryCornerRadius,\\n          boundaryScratchRef.current,\\n        );\\n        const key = `${vw.toFixed(1)}:${vh.toFixed(1)}:${b.widthPx.toFixed(1)}:${b.heightPx.toFixed(1)}:${b.cornerRadiusPx.toFixed(1)}`;\\n        if (key !== lastBoundaryKeyRef.current) {\\n          lastBoundaryKeyRef.current = key;\\n          const x0 = cx - b.halfW;\\n          const x1 = cx + b.halfW;\\n          const y0 = cy - b.halfH;\\n          const y1 = cy + b.halfH;\\n          const r = b.cornerRadiusPx;\\n          const arm = Math.max(8, Math.min(20, Math.min(b.innerHalfW, b.innerHalfH) * 0.22));\\n\\n          const paths = [\\n            // Top-left rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} L ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r).toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${(x0 + r).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} L ${(x0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Top-right rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${(x1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} L ${(x1 - r).toFixed(1)} ${y0.toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r).toFixed(1)} L ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Bottom-right rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} L ${x1.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r).toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${(x1 - r).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} L ${(x1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)}`,\\n            // Bottom-left rounded corner bracket\\n            `M ${(x0 + r + arm).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} L ${(x0 + r).toFixed(1)} ${y1.toFixed(1)} A ${r.toFixed(1)} ${r.toFixed(1)} 0 0 1 ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r).toFixed(1)} L ${x0.toFixed(1)} ${(y1 - r - arm).toFixed(1)}`,\\n          ];\\n\\n          for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n            cornerPathRefs.current[i]?.setAttribute(\'d\', paths[i]);\\n          }\\n\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.shape = \'rounded-rect\';\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.viewportWidth = vw.toFixed(1);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.viewportHeight = vh.toFixed(1);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.widthPx = b.widthPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.heightPx = b.heightPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.cornerRadiusPx = b.cornerRadiusPx.toFixed(2);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.widthFraction = b.widthFraction.toFixed(4);\\n          aimBoundarySvgRef.current.dataset.heightFraction = b.heightFraction.toFixed(4);\\n        }\\n\\n        const deflection = Math.max(Math.abs(t.aimNormalizedX), Math.abs(t.aimNormalizedY));\\n        const edgeOp =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'acceleration\'\\n            ? 0.3 + t.steeringAccelRatio * 0.24\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'transition\'\\n              ? 0.32\\n              : deflection > 0.25\\n                ? 0.08 + Math.min(1, (deflection - 0.25) / 0.75) * 0.18\\n                : 0.08;\\n        aimBoundarySvgRef.current.style.opacity = edgeOp.toFixed(2);\\n        aimBoundarySvgRef.current.style.color =\\n          t.steeringZone === \'acceleration\'\\n            ? \'rgba(186, 230, 253, 0.92)\'\\n            : t.steeringZone === \'transition\'\\n              ? \'rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.85)\'\\n              : \'rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.75)\';\\n      }\\n\\n      if (steerLineRef.current) {\\n        const dx = aimPxX - cx;\\n        const dy = aimPxY - cy;\\n        const distPx = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n        if (distPx > 14) {\\n          const ux = dx / distPx;\\n          const uy = dy / distPx;\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'x1\', (cx + ux * 10).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'y1\', (cy + uy * 10).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'x2\', (aimPxX - ux * 18).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.setAttribute(\'y2\', (aimPxY - uy * 18).toFixed(1));\\n          steerLineRef.current.style.opacity = String(Math.min(0.42, (distPx / 220) * 0.42).toFixed(2));\\n        } else {\\n          steerLineRef.current.style.opacity = \'0\';\\n        }\\n      }\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":563, \"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Subtle Sci-Fi Rounded-Rectangle Virtual Joystick Boundary (30% x 35% Base Viewport) */}\\n      <svg\\n        ref={aimBoundarySvgRef}\\n        data-testid=\\\"aim-boundary-frame\\\"\\n        className=\\\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 h-full w-full text-cyan-300/75\\\"\\n        style={{ opacity: 0.1, willChange: \'opacity, color\' }}\\n        aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n      >\\n        {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((idx) => (\\n          <path\\n            key={idx}\\n            ref={(el) => {\\n              cornerPathRefs.current[idx] = el;\\n            }}\\n            fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n            stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n            strokeWidth=\\\"1.5\\\"\\n            strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          />\\n        ))}\\n        <rect\\n          ref={deadzoneRectRef}\\n          fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n          stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n          strokeOpacity=\\\"0.4\\\"\\n          strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n          strokeDasharray=\\\"2 3\\\"\\n          style={{ visibility: \'hidden\' }}\\n        />\\n      </svg>\", \"StartLine\":541, \"TargetContent\":\"      {/* Subtle Sci-Fi Rounded-Rectangle Aiming Boundary Corner Markings (40% x 45% Viewport) */}\\n      <svg\\n        ref={aimBoundarySvgRef}\\n        data-testid=\\\"aim-boundary-frame\\\"\\n        className=\\\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 h-full w-full text-cyan-300/75\\\"\\n        style={{ opacity: 0.08, willChange: \'opacity, color\' }}\\n        aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n      >\\n        {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((idx) => (\\n          <path\\n            key={idx}\\n            ref={(el) => {\\n              cornerPathRefs.current[idx] = el;\\n            }}\\n            fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n            stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n            strokeWidth=\\\"1.5\\\"\\n            strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n          />\\n        ))}\\n      </svg>\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/FlightHUD.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating FlightHUD for Virtual Joystick\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update FlightHUD\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\235\034\n\232\034\001i\024}\023\231\354\220\304\332\332\210v\033X`\ro\276Y\310\257\3536\030\342PiO%\021\303\371\r\240\\\314\266 \310\326z7\231\326\344\205\254\245\206\356\372\323\203\360V\316\205\352E1\005\3110\240p[\234h\314\024?\241}\332\236\231r\233\351\252\207\263thK\032T\230k\223?\353\232\311F0\307\361\005M\025I\275\024\341\243{\006C\241,\212J|\241\\\303{$[\337W\204\001V\233#\331\310x\364\b\315K\006\240\024<!\214\006\n\354\020\b\022p\023F\313\361\r\265Xx\376,[v\221\006\033\370\236Nl\236\027\254\230\336z\342\267` ~\022\213\256\216w\362J\375CK\231@\233\224O\316Ez\350\2671\272\250\033o\a&\3158)\264\t^M\177\006\025\2757 \263\250\311\217l\034l\355k\005\303\224\0379\266\222\234&x\026\313:\374\031\211\264\301\225\204\256\300n\353\275\270\254\002|\226\202\254\200\344\273\276>\240Q\3177\363\261c\2537Q\330\314:>\331\317\276\006$\241\310\003M\223\002\032\306qR M*\226|S\000`\037T\360vq\330\r\372\237\307\024\340\344go\"h\350&\306\363\231\203N\t\373|7\253\t\333n\361\034\356\262\001Z\234y\"\n_\323>$\0212\203c(\022\303O\334\323xs\260\253\250VCY\337\fK\350\205\323\344\024n\212\351_\347\235\031\004_\025\025\232\333\237\225\274\274y\344<\250[\240\223\362\264\314\3603(Y\020<5V\327\231\005\':S\371E\340a}\316\\\000\327s}\032\315L\213\357\362\357R\332G:\360\307\347\000JG\361\024w^j\000c\316xo\223\300\377T\334\2143\t_\002k]\345\2532\300\\i\222>\334\264\345 dn\254F\036[\263\332\rtt\340\315C\371QT$d\a\200\275\271\315\302\273\300\017\266NK/\200\363v0\225\315=\307\006\034\210g\225\341\026\317\266\370\246\253,\227\025d\253\005(\343\243w\271\320\206ziY\035\245\271\236\327DG\004I\211\v\244d\334\2348\237\330\336X\345\214\363z\031\026\034#X5\241\302\020\334\036\263]\301\227\325q\313_}A\301\240\224|\031\257\315\214X\"7\361\213G\374\022\332\025\206\003K\221\343\377\204\227\333\016*nw&\214\366\022\221\342\333`S5\317\3265\270\225\263J\262\377\320Q\351\v-\006\263\3511\231fpK\331\342\025n\314L\336\320\345\212\263\276\004\031\370\002\336\177\256w\230\226T\256\257\241)v